# Teferi, Time Raveler: "Each opponent can cast spells only any time they could cast a sorcery." Bot2 holds two
# Lightning Bolts:
#   - turn 3, before Teferi: Bot2 casts the first Bolt at Bot1 in response to Bot1's Mox Jet, an instant on Bot1's
#     turn (CR 117.1a). This is the positive control for the refusal below.
#   - turn 3, after Teferi resolves: in Bot1's postcombat main phase, with the stack empty, the second Bolt is not
#     offered at all (not merely unaffordable, which would still count as offered).
#   - turn 4, Bot2's own main phase with an empty stack is sorcery timing (CR 307.1): Bot2 casts the second Bolt.

[Bot1 Deck]
Tundra
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Teferi, Time Raveler
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x20

