Bot1.Battlefield.Tundra.Activate(Ability: {U})
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Teferi, Time Raveler.Counters.Loyalty = 4
! Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast
